{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >///// Drill Rocket mining Action Game ! /////</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid hard rocks and obstacles and reach the goal !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lots of ore and buy power-up items such as HP up, SPEED delay, and Ultimate Skill at the SHOP to get an advantage in the game !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various mechanisms that will twist your brain !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turtle :\u00a0Avoid at the right time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DeadEnd : Look ahead and decide your route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BarrierMachine : Match color of gadget you are wearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper rocket goes into the mine, the more complex these mechanisms become, making the game even more difficult !\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right route and break through the 1200th wall !!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three difficulty levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Normal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard difficulty.\u00a0\u00a0Make the most of the SHOP.\u00a0 If you need, store lot energy for your Ultimate Skill and break through !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Hard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is 1600th Wall,\u00a0must collect points such as ore for each wall,\u00a0UltimateSkill energy can only be stored up to 100% (1 use),\u00a0WallSkip (checkpoint) range increased from 100 to 200 Walls, etc.\u00a0Challenging difficulty with added difficult conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Hardest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is 1600st Wall.\u00a0You will only be able to buy WallSkip in the SHOP.\u00a0Very difficult difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your preferred difficulty and enjoy the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Normal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3955800/e2d5b337a7e69b9afb61fffebf32c21f815d33f5.jpg"},{"name":"Hard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3955800/3f04b5f074f6b4dfe9ca3e3489b2b80265647648.jpg"},{"name":"Hardest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3955800/fd0f1dcede63ce94dc2e15480a56d58090dd91b0.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955800?t=1758233231","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955800?t=1758233231","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955800/3a3ed5107a405d97c0228ee9856e68560545b019/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758233231","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955800/3a3ed5107a405d97c0228ee9856e68560545b019/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758233231","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >///// Drill Rocket mining Action Game ! /////</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid hard rocks and obstacles and reach the goal !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lots of ore and buy power-up items such as HP up, SPEED delay, and Ultimate Skill at the SHOP to get an advantage in the game !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various mechanisms that will twist your brain !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turtle :\u00a0Avoid at the right time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DeadEnd : Look ahead and decide your route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BarrierMachine : Match color of gadget you are wearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 